["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"695. Can the U.S. Close Its Fertility Gap? fertility gap tempo effect instrumental variable strategy redlining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-freakonomics-居家办公让美国多生了30万个孩子-比任何育儿补贴都有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">56:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>居家办公让美国多生了30万个孩子，比任何育儿补贴都有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府发钱催生基本无效，但远程办公这个免费副产品让美国生育率实打实上升——夫妻各自每周在家一天以上，生育意愿就能从1.7冲到2.2。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">住房政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"516 从马克·布洛赫入祀先贤祠看年鉴学派与当代法国社会文化思潮 Annales School Panthéon longue durée\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-cn2aa250-马克-布洛赫入祀先贤祠-历史学家如何被总统们轮流消费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>马克·布洛赫入祀先贤祠：历史学家如何被总统们轮流消费</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布洛赫生前反感学术权力、拒绝种族身份标签，死后却成了历届法国总统塑造「抵抗总统」人设的工具，他的家属也因此分裂成赞成与反对两派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">年鉴学派</span><span class=\"tag\">法国史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.291｜杂吧地：天桥艺人和他们的江湖｜嘉宾：岳永逸×孟庆延 杂巴地 撂地 海清 三不管\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-cn27f438-金庸写的是山林幻想-天桥艺人的江湖才是真实的中国社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>金庸写的是山林幻想，天桥艺人的江湖才是真实的中国社会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">连阔如亲历的江湖，是国家行政力量管不到的地方、一个行业自发形成规矩、靠口碑而非头衔维系秩序的真实生活世界；金庸笔下那个门派林立的江湖，其实更接近陶渊明式的山林幻想。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗学</span><span class=\"tag\">江湖文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Bedtime Battles: 5 Mistakes Making Sleep Harder From Toddlers to Teens\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-raisinggh-睡前谈判-开着电视-太兴奋-五个让孩子更难入睡的习惯/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4ab6c930f328d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>睡前谈判、开着电视、太兴奋：五个让孩子更难入睡的习惯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子抗拒睡觉不是叛逆而是生理反应，真正拖垮睡眠的是父母自己制造的睡前刺激、顺序混乱、屏幕、讨价还价和环境问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童睡眠</span><span class=\"tag\">养育方式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"特番｜从做题家变成出题家，才能为硬技术找新用途\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-bizthisway-红外公司转型做质检设备时发现-自己只值10-的生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>红外公司转型做质检设备时发现：自己只值10%的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做红外全身医疗筛查时，高德质感提供的技术只占整个诊断服务价值的10%，剩下90%靠医疗认知和现场服务——于是他们放弃自己包办，转向只卖核心零部件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">红外技术</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a $2 Billion Law Firm Suddenly Collapsed eat what you kill lockstep compensation fraudulent transfer liability MSO (managed service organization) generational conflict\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-oddlots-合伙制律所能在零负债-利润仍增长时突然倒闭/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>合伙制律所能在零负债、利润仍增长时突然倒闭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家95年历史的华尔街律所没有巨额负债，利润也逐年上升，却因增速跑输同行，在几个月内像银行挤兑一样瓦解，证明合伙制企业的致命伤是相对而非绝对表现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">合伙制</span><span class=\"tag\">律所治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Bravo, Comrade Lysenko! The Man who Failed to Feed the USSR vernalisation Lysenkoism Green Revolution\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-cautionary-苏联农学家靠一盆花拒绝做实验-饿死了同行也没喂饱苏联/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>苏联农学家靠一盆花拒绝做实验，饿死了同行也没喂饱苏联</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李森科说「饥饿不等人」拒绝田间试验，靠花盆里的一株麦子就宣布培育成功；博洛格同样面对饥荒，却用更多对照实验喂饱了墨西哥。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科学方法</span><span class=\"tag\">苏联历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nvidia After Jensen Huang, What Huang Meant to the AI Ecosystem, Washington Gets Its Revenge Neoclouds Mellanox / MVLink N-2 rule MSS honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-sharptech-黄仁勋下台不是桃色事件-是华盛顿对英伟达积怨已久的总清算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋下台不是桃色事件，是华盛顿对英伟达积怨已久的总清算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达对华出口政策上屡次顶撞国安系统，才是黄仁勋被赶下台背后真正的导火索，绯闻只是压垮他的最后一根稻草。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片禁令</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"187: 对话LiberAI刘松铭：Astra来袭，00后物理AI创始人看到的胜率 VLA WAM System 0/1/2 Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-latetalk-物理ai创始人提前押注硬件-基模一来-模型就会变薄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90e5508108d67243-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:09:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>物理AI创始人提前押注硬件：基模一来，模型就会变薄</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘松铭创业时就判断GPT-6 Astra这类基模会吃掉具身智能的「System 2」部分，于是从第一天就把硬件和产品做成护城河，而不是先做一家纯模型公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI红娘，3小时融资1500万｜王钦文对话曾歆勋 EV1匹配 T度\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-wangqinwen-良配巴不得用户尽快离开-这恰恰是它的赚钱逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">王</div><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>良配巴不得用户尽快离开，这恰恰是它的赚钱逻辑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">良配卖的是不可续费会员，用户配对成功就该走人——用户走得越快，平台要烧的token越少，这跟靠留存赚钱的多数AI产品正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">婚恋社交</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"156. 《侠》｜对影之刃零制作人梁其伟6小时访谈\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-zhangxiaojun-踩中风口在成功里只占1-99-是你是不是那块料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66aff61ecaa4b4d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">6:27:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>踩中风口在成功里只占1%，99%是你是不是那块料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梁其伟用自己多年做游戏的教训说：风口和资本叙事能撑起短期流水，但真正决定命运的，从来是创作者的心性而非外部环境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">武侠文化</span><span class=\"tag\">游戏行业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang Is Out at Nvidia Megaspeed entity list GTC TerraFab circular funding deals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-hardfork-黄仁勋因间谍绯闻辞任英伟达ceo-公司内部找不到能接替他的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋因间谍绯闻辞任英伟达CEO,公司内部找不到能接替他的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">继任的CFO只能是过渡CEO,因为英伟达的掌舵人必须同时是顶尖计算机科学家、能对台湾供应商发飙的强人，这种人目前只有黄仁勋一个。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Indonesia’s Mega Rice Failure peatland Mega Rice Project Dayak\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-asianometry-苏哈托为挽救政治声誉-把婆罗洲泥炭地烧成了灾难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c10c2e5a1a2f5743-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>苏哈托为挽救政治声誉，把婆罗洲泥炭地烧成了灾难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏哈托为延续「发展之父」声誉强推百万公顷稻田计划，却因泥炭地不适农耕、规划缺失，最终酿成东南亚史上最大碳排放火灾事件之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">环境政策</span><span class=\"tag\">农业史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why an early Alzheimer’s theory is making a comeback, the U.S.’s electricity crisis, and improving precision medicine cholinergic hypothesis nucleus basalis of Meynert HVDC / VSC All of Us pharmacogenomics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-sciencepod-阿尔茨海默病老牌假说被雪藏四十年-影像证据证明它可能是对的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b4ddc3718996fb27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>阿尔茨海默病老牌假说被雪藏四十年，影像证据证明它可能是对的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位年轻学者用影像数据证明，脑深部胆碱能神经元的退化先于、而非跟随皮层淀粉样蛋白沉积，让被淀粉样蛋白假说挤下舞台的老理论重新被认真对待。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿尔茨海默病</span><span class=\"tag\">淀粉样蛋白假说</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Anthropic on the cusp of RSI? Inside the redacted METR report | Luisa Rodriguez recursive self-improvement AI 2027\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-eightythousand-metr-发现-anthropic-用-ai-造-ai-速度已翻倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a5c1f36515a82c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">15:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>METR 发现 Anthropic 用 AI 造 AI，速度已翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">METR 调查认为，Anthropic 当前研发提速约八成来自用自家 AI 做研究，这正是外界警告多年的递归自我改进的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Is the ‘War on Science’ Over? MAHA (Make America Healthy Again) filibuster\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-sciencevs-数据中心成了美国中期选举最大输家之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>数据中心成了美国中期选举最大输家之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">国会审批权没变但执行层已被政治筛查渗透；民主党拿下参众两院也撼动不了特朗普对科学的实际控制权，真正让选民投票的是AI数据中心的电费和噪音。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科研资助</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Next Era of Games: Mods, Agents, and Infinite Worlds modding decompilation 3.js\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-a16z-ai-让做游戏从十年压到两年-烂genre要迎来文艺复兴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让做游戏从十年压到两年，烂genre要迎来文艺复兴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GTA6 开发花了十二年，a16z 两位合伙人认为 AI 工具已经能把游戏原型周期压缩到数周，这会让工作室敢在冷门类型和新 IP 上下注，而不是只敢做续作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">游戏开发</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Powering AI-Driven Drug Discovery with President of Isomorphic Labs Max Jaderberg AlphaFold organoids / organs on a chip CRO (contract research organization)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-nopriors-药物研发卡住的根源不是审批太严-而是临床前看不见毒性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/75fbbd0fbc432e9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>药物研发卡住的根源不是审批太严，而是临床前看不见毒性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Isomorphic Labs 的判断是：药物成本飙升主要来自临床阶段的失败，而失败根源在于临床前根本看不到毒性——大鼠毒性测试对人类的预测力只有约三成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI制药</span><span class=\"tag\">药物研发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can Network Science Transform Health and Nutrition? preferential attachment scale-free network disease module foodome dark matter of nutrition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-thejoyofwhy-食物里还藏着13-5万种-暗物质-分子-科学还不知道它们在做什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1991479e40b3c047-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Joy of Why</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>食物里还藏着13.5万种「暗物质」分子，科学还不知道它们在做什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">网络科学家发现，食物中除了约150种已知营养成分外，还有13.5万种从未被归类的分子——它们不提供能量，却像成千上万种药物一样在细胞里做微调控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络科学</span><span class=\"tag\">无标度网络</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Winners and Losers of Index Investing (Martin Schmalz) | #435 common ownership horizon-dependent risk aversion tragedy of the commons volatility laundering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-rationalreminder-指数基金对每个人都理性-模型里却可能让所有人集体变穷/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>指数基金对每个人都理性，模型里却可能让所有人集体变穷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当分散投资变得够便宜，资金从个股和债券涌入股市，推高股价、压低预期回报——每个人都做了对自己最优的选择，结果却可能是所有人一起变差，这是一场公地悲剧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数投资</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Origins of the Affordable Care Act Medicare for all single-payer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-throughline-肯尼迪晚年最大遗憾-1974年差点和尼克松谈成全民医保/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">28:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>肯尼迪晚年最大遗憾：1974年差点和尼克松谈成全民医保</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">尼克松在水门事件最绝望时提出的医改方案，比后来的奥巴马医保更激进，肯尼迪却因盟友压力放弃谈判，事后称这是他政治生涯最大的遗憾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗保险</span><span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Robots on Fire: The Army’s $500 Million Factory Fiasco undefinitized contracting action flow forming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-papertrail-5亿美元炮弹新厂两年颗粒无收-军方却从不索回一分钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42070ee0db99b191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">34:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>5亿美元炮弹新厂两年颗粒无收，军方却从不索回一分钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">General Dynamics 从土耳其引进的新设备两年没造出一发合格炮弹，军队停了两条产线后仍照常支付进度款，既不索赔也不终止合同，反而继续给这家公司新合同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防采购</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Liquidating a whale by hand, 22 times margin call DeFi lending protocol wrapped token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-complexsys-手动清算一个巨鲸的仓位22次-杠杆率只是四年级除法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/869854f30ccd1804-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">22:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>手动清算一个巨鲸的仓位22次：杠杆率只是四年级除法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FTX崩盘期间，Solend上一个巨鲸账户资不抵债，程序没能自动清算，作者靠手动点按钮22次完成了清算机器人该做的事，顺带赚了约50%收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆</span><span class=\"tag\">DeFi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Nvidia&#x27;s Megaspeed Scandal Is Really All About NVIDIA Cloud Partner (NCP) AI diffusion rule remote access zero-day inferencing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-oddlots-nvidia对华芯片管控的最大漏洞-不卖芯片-租给你用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>NVIDIA对华芯片管控的最大漏洞：不卖芯片，租给你用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Megaspeed用46亿美元买进NVIDIA芯片转租阿里巴巴，远程访问不违法；NVIDIA核查后仍有5万块芯片下落不明，部分是最先进的Blackwell。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span>\n</div></div></a>"]